      "text": "Kanu waa aniga.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52406#page=1",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:399fdb8e10b0017c51180db9a8a3a04c416d0318c814b249e9533817d8905f1a"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/27545.png",
      "text": "Waxaan la noolahay hooyaday, walaalkay iyo walaashay.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52406#page=2",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:eabe297ce7eceeb9ceb4c511c6253f6de01bbecc47576dda702878d762677160"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/27546.png",
      "text": "Hooyaday waxay jeceshahay cunta karinta.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52406#page=3",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:f8e49d7d532fac56f3477191d005f2b1dbef3bc31cd60cb4462a60999ab4e8bb"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/27547.png",
      "text": "Mararka qaar hooyaday waxay booqataa saaxiibadeed.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52406#page=4",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:7dcc73d4538741a60000c55d0b251c785c092d6b644fe54f067c707cc7fb86e8"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/27548.png",
      "text": "Markay maqantahay, gurigaan nadiifiyaa, weelkana waan dhaqaa.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52406#page=5",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:e36a24bdc977eca606dbb52017187899d11813e647c8520f0e62902e082ff30b"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/27549.png",
      "text": "Markay habeenkii tahay, hooyaday waxay noo sheegtaa in aan tukano.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52406#page=6",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:0654e052d78c86ab7622aea1181d081280b0f2d4d7fbe2c9cec048624ace361c"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/27550.png",
      "text": "Markay tahay dhalashadayda, hooyaday waxbay ii keentaa.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52406#page=7",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:470a8226ccb313ccf2e151cd9cb3b03bb83d17fa38f11e132895107b64bdbf4d"
    },
